{"RTF": 0.0396111362084056, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.16141198101104237, "audio_duration_seconds": 4.0751020408163265, "category": "stress_homograph", "chunk_count": 1, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 4.0751020408163265, "first_chunk_samples": 89856, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "На горе стоит старый замок, а на двери сломан замок.", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S01", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 89856, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 1, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.16141942200192716, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S01_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "d5ec6f04ef115e09dae24e94af7e2cc14d332a71df71ae205ca881d9abb75c11"}
{"RTF": 0.03951807406294991, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.2610506689961767, "audio_duration_seconds": 6.606077097505669, "category": "stress_sensitive", "chunk_count": 1, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 6.606077097505669, "first_chunk_samples": 145664, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "Мы позвоним вам завтра, а сегодня я проверю договор и передам информацию коллеге.", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S02", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 145664, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 2, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.2610594440047862, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S02_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "e9d865e5f4c1950c9bfa0cc3a0a2ae4ac3c28b7fd68aa5e093100c13d557e108"}
{"RTF": 0.04786537768198698, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.34120102900487836, "audio_duration_seconds": 7.128526077097506, "category": "conversational", "chunk_count": 1, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 7.128526077097506, "first_chunk_samples": 157184, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "Всё хорошо, платёж ещё не прошёл, но я уже вижу операцию и сейчас всё проверю.", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S03", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 157184, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 3, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.34120959299616516, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S03_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "c40135f6df69dd9cbc3506ec003f7e5504614bfd485c17fedb990276f68387dd"}
{"RTF": 0.043711823183594754, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.7135273210005835, "audio_duration_seconds": 16.32362811791383, "category": "numbers_dates_names_verbalized", "chunk_count": 1, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 16.32362811791383, "first_chunk_samples": 359936, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "Алексей Петров, заявка номер одна тысяча двести пятьдесят восемь зарегистрирована восемнадцатого сентября две тысячи двадцать шестого года на сумму пятнадцать тысяч четыреста восемьдесят рублей семьдесят пять копеек.", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S04", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 359936, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 4, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.713535546005005, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S04_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "f9346c85a426aa676bbfa6a1970f96f0cd83ff84fe8a81284936c42b2d1bad8f"}
{"RTF": 0.0404244230673348, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.044566254000528716, "audio_duration_seconds": 7.987664399092971, "category": "call_center_neutral", "chunk_count": 3, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 0.9868480725623583, "first_chunk_samples": 21760, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "Добрый день. Я вижу ваше обращение. Пожалуйста, оставайтесь на линии, я проверю информацию по вашему заказу.", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S05", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 176128, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 5, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.3228967249888228, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S05_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "73b98995cd8f38083ce13df9ab0e67931ffff98d9f8da5203b058489dd691cc1"}
{"RTF": 0.042784620926402735, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.24514936200284865, "audio_duration_seconds": 9.578231292517007, "category": "call_center_question", "chunk_count": 2, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 5.410249433106576, "first_chunk_samples": 119296, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "Подскажите, пожалуйста, последние четыре цифры номера и дату операции. Правильно ли я понимаю, что списание произошло сегодня утром?", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S06", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 211200, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 6, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.4098009949957486, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S06_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "593a331397a0d4e605023c8f73848d6f0692a02abf6aac662d033cc9ea947d60"}
{"RTF": 0.039575932885149157, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.06173574199783616, "audio_duration_seconds": 11.110748299319727, "category": "call_center_reassurance", "chunk_count": 3, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 1.4628571428571429, "first_chunk_samples": 32256, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "Спасибо за ожидание. Я нашла причину задержки: платёж принят банком, но подтверждение ещё обрабатывается. Повторно оплачивать заказ сейчас не нужно.", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S07", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 244992, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 7, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.43971822899766266, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S07_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "5f974c2ece3e58f32b6431c050f6a51280a823f828bc5d8c24d3d8deb6ba1e96"}
{"RTF": 0.04478136989508174, "TTFA_sentence_chunk_seconds": 0.829248189998907, "audio_duration_seconds": 18.517913832199547, "category": "long_sentence", "chunk_count": 1, "delivery_mode": "sentence_chunked", "disk_write_in_timing": false, "first_chunk_audio_seconds": 18.517913832199547, "first_chunk_samples": 408320, "input_protocol": "primary_plain", "input_text": "Если после обновления приложения статус не изменится, закройте его полностью, откройте снова и проверьте историю операций; если платёж по-прежнему не отображается, сообщите мне время и сумму перевода, и я передам обращение специалисту.", "inter_op_num_threads": 1, "intra_op_num_threads": 2, "model_load_in_timing": false, "per_prompt_seed": null, "prompt_id": "S08", "provider": "CPUExecutionProvider", "rng_contract": "session_seed_fixed_order", "samples": 408320, "sampling_rate_hz": 22050, "sequence_index": 8, "session_seed": 52000, "system_id": "piper_ru_irina_medium", "ttfa_granularity": "first_complete_sentence_chunk", "wall_inference_seconds": 0.8292575490049785, "warmup_excluded": true, "wav_path": "/home/nuc/projects/ru_melotts_research/artifacts/benchmarks/cross_model_tts_benchmark_v1_draft/renders/piper_ru_irina_medium/S08_irina.wav", "wav_sha256": "6bf70bc7607e9b34d28a67136e768805abb9e8356f6acd2d6cd1a07f8d58d80e"}
